PS5 Pro GPU: Viola firmware, GPU governor, telemetry, no PS5 frequency drivers

- PS5 Pro GPU support (upstream #58 by Borchev, ported to 7.3)
- PS5 Pro: CPU and GPU frequency drivers left out
- PS5 Pro: upstream #66 (Borchev), ported to 7.3
- PS5 Pro: GPU load and metrics with the Viola firmware
